# Copy this to weather.conf (in the same directory) and fill in your own
# location. weather.conf itself is gitignored -- it identifies a home
# address to within a few hundred metres, so it never leaves this machine.
#
# Coordinates can be looked up without an API key:
#     curl 'https://geocoding-api.open-meteo.com/v1/search?name=<town>&count=1'
#
# All four are optional; without this file the widget defaults to the
# centre of Vienna, which is a landmark rather than anybody's house.

LAT=47.2692
LON=11.4041
TZ=Europe/Vienna
PLACE=Innsbruck
